{"id":"w4168h0wd4sd5e4r3owm3ktvl","title":"人狂犬病及其控制","originalTitle":"狂犬病未来的发展与面临的挑战（四）人狂犬病及其控制","summary":"人狂犬病在非洲流行国家仍被忽视，因文化与宗教原因，患者常求助于传统治疗者。预防措施包括暴露前免疫（Pr-EP）和暴露后免疫（PEP），但高成本疫苗和免疫球蛋白使预防和治疗难以普及。新型、低成本疫苗的研发迫在眉睫，WHO推荐使用细胞培养和鸡胚疫苗，但经济因素限制了其广泛应用。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=347754&do=blog&id=1561186"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-15T02:28:33.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-15T01:56:40.529Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-15T01:56:40.529Z","category":"clinical","tags":["研究成果"],"score":34,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"58f4938e-8b9d-4bbe-81d5-1b7bcdd6b023","title":"非洲人狂犬病防控困境与WHO疫苗推荐矛盾"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"58f4938e-8b9d-4bbe-81d5-1b7bcdd6b023","title":"非洲人狂犬病防控困境与WHO疫苗推荐矛盾"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fBsLZ-FyvKxo","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}